WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
1. Add a clear photo of the affected leaf, fruit, or stem.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
2. Tap Check crop. You do not need to type anything.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
3. Read the care steps. The app may be unsure.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
4. Open My reports to find your saved reports.
